Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:29.09,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暮光之城3：月食》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说 世界将终结于火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say the world will end in fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说会葬送于冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say in ice…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾尝过欲望之果\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I've tasted of desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞同终结于火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold with those who favor fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若非要两度沉沦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I had to perish twice…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我对仇恨了解够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know enough of hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说 如果是毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say that, for destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬送于冰也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice, is also great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 我英语要期末考\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've got an English final.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得专心复习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,转化我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你嫁给我 我就答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey I will if you marry me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做折衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做强迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just called coercion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻只不过是一纸证书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage is just…is a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的时代 这是表明「我爱你」的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I am from, it's the way one says, "I love you".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的时代 我这个年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I come from, at my age…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚意味着「这孩子怀孕了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the way one says, "I just got knocked up".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在意大家的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're worried about what people will think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分之二的婚姻都以离婚收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's two out of three marriages end in divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 吸血鬼和人类结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think you'll find the…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的离婚率大概会低些\N{\fnArial\fs30}vampire, human divorce rate is a little lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嫁给我吧 - 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just marry me. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四点要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be back at four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿观察家）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（被杀 失踪 怀疑为连环杀手作案 乔治城小巷发现又一受害者）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,四点准时回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four o'clock on the dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子现在是想讨好我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid trying to brown nose me now or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家有名字 你现在嫌他太守时了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a name. And now he's too punctual for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道自己为什么被禁足 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand why you're being punished, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 因为我太让你担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I put you through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我担心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我将你禁足有别的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have other reasons, for grounding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你和他保持一定距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to get some separation from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, there is nothing you can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华是我生命中的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward is in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这我十分清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm gathering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不如这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, alright. How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做个约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你解除禁令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not grounded anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你自由之后 也会去见其他朋友的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If…You use your new found freedom…to see some of your other friends too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 见雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…Like Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如今的日子很不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going through a really tough time right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爸爸很担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Dad's really worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得 你伤心的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要朋友安慰 那时陪在你身边的是雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed a friend, Jake was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雅各 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Jake.Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布好几周没理我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob hadn't talk to me in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要和好 可是他不给我机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to fix it, he just…He wouldn't give me the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要去保留地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going now to the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爱丽丝预见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们连我的车也盯着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do this to my truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你要理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, you have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的安全就是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your safety is everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布绝不会伤害我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob is not gonna hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有意伤害你 但狼人容易失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not intentionally, but the wolves have no control…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 直到毕业前 我都可以去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward!I have…until graduation, to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我就会成为吸血鬼 他会永远恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be one of you, and he'll hate me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 来得正好 听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Just in time. Alright, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,同学们 我们是未来的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fellow students.We are the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything is possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切皆有可能 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …If you just believe. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完美 - 准备个演讲稿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perfect. - And got yourself a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 要是拿这个当演讲稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this will be my speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我想被大家丢来的毕业证砍死\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I want everyone to throw diplomas at my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西你就守着这些陈词滥调吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya gotta embrace the cliches, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些陈词滥调 每个演说者都会说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the bread and butter of all valedictorians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你当不了毕业演讲代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is why you are not valedictorian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西不需要这些陈词滥调\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jess doesn't need cliches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的演讲会很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech is gonna be epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 那会改写人生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epic? It'll change lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算开个派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to throw a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道我们还要从高中毕业多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, how many times we gonna graduate high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开派对 在你家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A party? At your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没去过你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有人去过他们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever seen their house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又要开派对吗 爱丽丝 - 会很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another party, Alice? - It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你上次也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.That's what you said last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安吉拉 - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Angela. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need some help with those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她预见了什么 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know what she saw. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looked worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是担心大家看出爱丽丝的异常反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that everyone would notice how strange Alice is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过去那么久了 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that ship sailed long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,西雅图有个人失踪一年多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone missing in Seattle, over a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理正在想办法 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie is doing what he can, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know something about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在追踪西雅图的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been tracking the situation in Seattle for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,离奇失踪 不明原因死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unexplained disappearances, killings…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果事态再扩大的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the situation gets anymore conspicuous,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族家族就会介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Volturi will step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们去西雅图 就有可能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they go to Seattle, they can come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会发现 我还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can see I'm still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't get that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有必要 我们会去西雅图\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll go to Seattle if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会第一时间传真给你们 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll fax these down the first thing. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以去吃晚饭了吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're ready for dinner? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们两人一起吃晚饭 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is still just…you and I, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我只是顺路送她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm just dropping her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回头见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我父母让我提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella. My parents wanted to remind you about the…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘了用生日那天送你的机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}airline ticket you got for your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}What airline ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去佛罗里达州看妈妈的往返机票\N{\fnArial\fs30}A round trip ticket to see Mom in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真慷慨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就过期了 他们建议你这周末用掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it expires soon, they say you might wanna use it this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.23,0:12:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能抛下一切 说去就去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just drop everything and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许是你毕业前最后一次见她的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be your last chance to see her before you graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这提议不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出城几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the town for a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}get some distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我可以去看妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wouldn't mind seeing Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要用情侣票和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you use the companion ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你们两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just two tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可让我高兴到死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实想去看看妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did wanna see my Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看到她的生活美满幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to know that her life was full by satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怀念这感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you gonna miss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怀念沐浴在阳光下的舒适感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you just feel the vitamin D soaking up in your pores?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我会很怀念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm gonna miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗里达的大学阳光会更加明媚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, colleges in Florida are a lot sunnier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 如果你去阿拉斯加大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, if you go to university of Alaska…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就再也见不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的科研项目不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a really great science program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个项目名称叫爱德华吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Edward program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看你的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he watches you…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛愿意跳到你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he's willing to leap in front of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你挡子弹一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take a bullet or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非常强烈的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an intense thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他在一起 你也变得不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们彼此吸引 像磁铁一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he moves, you move.Like magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不清 我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, we're just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠入爱河 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}In love.I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做出了对的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're making the right choices for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 要和他在一起的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, cause you're the one who's gonna have to live with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.11,0:13:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 沉重的话题到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, enough with the heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. - Congraduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想花你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to spending your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没花钱 快打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你所有的旧旅行T恤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these all our old trip T-shirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 拿出来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都留着呢 能做一床很好的被子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved'em all.I thought they'd make a good quilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你在阿拉斯加也不会冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep you warm up in Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得这个吗 恩桑那达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember this one?Ensanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蛇窖 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The snake pit. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个是我最喜欢的 看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this one is my favourite.Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅因州的三头龙虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three-headed lobster in Maine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这礼物太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 真高兴你能喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey. I'm glad you've like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 等你长大 有了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just figured, you know, when you get older, have kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能再加上几件 也许能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can add to it.Maybe go visit…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看世界上最大的番茄酱瓶之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world's largest catsup bottle or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢 我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得 你在阿拉斯加的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought, you should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这东西就像我陪在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little piece of me, up there in Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很想你 - 宝贝 我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I miss you. - Honey. I miss you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这是你看到她的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is where you saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 她进入他们的领地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! She's in their territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No she won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃美特 不要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emmett, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后悔去那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you regret going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到妈妈我很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really great to see my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是要告别真的很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just really hard saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以不用和她告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你让我去的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you ask me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I was gonna change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直这么希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always hoping for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要你留在车里 你会听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I asked you to stay in the car, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理说你出城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie said you left town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 去看我妈妈 出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. To visit my Mom, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.07,0:18:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想证实你还是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking to see if you're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来警告你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming here to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们再到我们的领地上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your kind come on our land again…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没告诉她吗 - 别插手 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't tell her? - Just leave it alone, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃美特和保罗有点误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emmett and Paul had a misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得轻巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出城也是被你骗出去的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lie to get her out of town, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该离开了 现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should leave.Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有权利知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a right to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是红发吸血鬼要抓的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is the one the red-head wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说维多利亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝预见的是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice's vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}By lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这件事我们以后再谈 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey. We're gonna talk about this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you called me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无话可说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我有好多话要说 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tons. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 你要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, you have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him I don't trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太得意 雅各布 我们只是去兜一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the grin, Jacob.We're just going for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure, this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 我是「吸血鬼女孩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a "vampire girl", remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看谁回来了 - 贝拉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look who's back. - What's up, Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奎尔 你呢 - 很好 终于加入大伙儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quil, you too? - Yep. Finally made the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.48,0:20:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 真高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总算不用听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can get a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各没完没了的内心独白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Jake's obsessive inner monologue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望贝拉打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I wish Bella would call."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望贝拉打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I wish Bella wouldn't call".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该给贝拉打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maybe I should call Bella".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该给贝拉打电话 然后挂断\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maybe I should call Bella and hang up".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们都闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, you can shut up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 这是莉亚·克里尔沃特 哈利的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, this is Leah Clearwater.Harry's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 对于你父亲的死 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.I'm really sorry about your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是来这里折磨雅各布的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're here to torture Jacob some more,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就请离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel free to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真有意思 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella… Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想什么时候能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering when we'd see your face around here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.47,0:21:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在不会轻易越界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't be getting through our line anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉亚什么时候加入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when did Leah joined the pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在他父亲死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around when her Dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的弟弟赛斯也变身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her brother Seth, also phased.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才15岁 是我们中最小的成员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only fifteen. One of the youngest we've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆一直让他在家学习 但他对此十分不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam keeps him home studying, but he's chomping at the bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望加入的不是莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish it was Leah who'd stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别大男子主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't be such a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是因为她是女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's… It's not a chick thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.85,0:22:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是 三角关系太复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… You know, a triangle thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉亚 山姆和艾米粒三人的痛苦 我们感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have to live the Leah, Sam, Emily pain-fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.17,0:22:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我说的狼人的心理感应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolf telepathy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 山姆为了艾米粒抛弃了莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam dumps Leah for Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.05,0:22:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆为伤害莉亚而痛恨自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam hates himself for hurting Leah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但艾米粒是他的真命天女\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Emily was The One.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我想有时是要做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess it's sort of chooses you sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是喜欢而已 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than some crush, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.35,0:22:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米粒是山姆的烙印爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam imprinted on Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I want to know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,烙印的爱是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imprinting on someone is like…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看到她 一切都变得不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like when you see her, everything changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你捆绑在地球上的不是重力\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not gravity holding you to the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的事情不再重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意为她做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.27,0:23:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成任何样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}be anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来好像你知道那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like you know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有烙印爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you imprinted on someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有 你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd know if I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.42,0:23:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是对山姆有直接感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a direct line to Sam's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说 你 还是原来的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for now, you're… still you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.20,0:23:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是原来的你 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you're still you.- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.27,0:24:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.39,0:24:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Graduation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.35,0:24:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道终究会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是在一个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 不能在你 在你还活着就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not before you've… you've even lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.05,0:24:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者在我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or before I could…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.67,0:24:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一秒 就一秒 我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second, just a second, I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.24,0:24:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他让你陷得那么深\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's got his hooks in you so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的决定 与他无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided this, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 他们甚至都不是活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, they're not even alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿你死了也比变成他们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better you really be dead than one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信你居然那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华是对的 我不该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward was right, I shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 拜托 别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, come on. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.48,0:25:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.14,0:26:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.86,0:26:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华起码也该尊重下晚饭时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward could at least respect meal times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和雅各在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just with Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.69,0:26:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那敢情好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.61,0:26:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我给你们一些私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just give you two some privacy then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.01,0:26:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我有多担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand how worried I've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.11,0:26:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点就打破协约以确保你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost break the treaty to make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.57,0:26:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 身上有狗味儿 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I smell like a dog. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.01,0:26:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是 有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.14,0:27:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.66,0:27:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁 我们认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it? Someone we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.01,0:27:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,陌生人 我不认识他的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a stranger. I didn't recognize his scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.17,0:27:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,过路的流浪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nomad passing through?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.73,0:27:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,过路者是不会让贝拉的父亲活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A passer-by wouldn't have left Bella's father alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.43,0:27:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的气味在贝拉家以南五英里处消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His scent disappeared about five miles south of Bella's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.17,0:27:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是有预谋的 - 维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone's orchestrating this.- Victoria?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到她做这个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've seen her deciding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.88,0:27:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是沃尔图里家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.94,0:27:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也不是沃尔图里家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's the Volturi either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.25,0:27:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一直监视着埃罗的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been watching Aro's decisions, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们接着搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,并轮班守护贝拉和她家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also take shifts, guarding Bella at her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.47,0:27:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又一个保护差事 - 罗莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another protection detail?- Rosalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.89,0:27:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她说得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.53,0:27:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能一边保护我 看护我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't protect me, watch my dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.28,0:27:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,又同时搜捕入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and search for the intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.93,0:27:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上找维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.41,0:27:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要喂饱你们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep yourselves fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:27:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你毫无保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you here defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 我也不能让你饿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not gonna let you starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.40,0:28:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说我不会是毫无保护的 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wouldn't be unprotected, I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.39,0:28:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.48,0:28:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁 他的气味留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever it was, he left his stink behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.38,0:28:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次碰到一定不会放过他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be hard to miss when we cross it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.22,0:28:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就从这入手 - 不需要你插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll handle it from here.- We don't need you to handle anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要任何人插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管你需不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could care less what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.16,0:28:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你才不干了 - 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're done here.- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很烦这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.02,0:28:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始我中立 行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on I'm Switzerland, Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华不喜欢这个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward hated the idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.51,0:28:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这已无关竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't about rivalry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是事关我和查理的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was about my safety, and Charlie's.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.84,0:28:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来几天我好歹让他们能够合作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the days that followed I got them to at least try to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.25,0:28:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人们接班\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wolves took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.13,0:28:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样卡伦一家可以去捕食\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the Cullen's can hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.95,0:29:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真不是什么和睦的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't exactly an easy alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连件上衣都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't he own a shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里很好了 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good here, you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会走远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be going long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.35,0:29:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 你需要好好捕食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't rush. You need to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.11,0:29:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是稍微急一点点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you rush a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.56,0:30:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 美女 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, beautiful.- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.85,0:30:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 今天想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what ya wanna do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.78,0:30:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑车 散步 闲逛 听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bike, hike, hang? Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.34,0:30:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们今晚去个聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we're going to a party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这样行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.97,0:30:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不喜欢做聚会的不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hate being a party crasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.63,0:30:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 你是个商讨会的不速之客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, you're a Council Meeting crasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.97,0:30:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 会议领袖 爸爸 奎尔的爷爷 还有苏·克里尔沃特\N{\fnArial\fs30}See. The Council leaders, Dad, Quil's grandpa, and Sue Clearwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.71,0:30:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利死后她接的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took over for Harry when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.63,0:30:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我其实不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.22,0:30:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么的 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他们认为你应该听听这些历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they thought it would be good for you to hear the histories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.61,0:30:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}The histories?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,部落的历史 不是机密的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tribe's histories? Aren't they secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.67,0:30:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都身居其中 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got a role to play. And you're a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.95,0:31:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这也是赛斯莉亚和奎尔第一次聆听历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's the first time Seth, Leah and Quil are hearing them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.06,0:31:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过你是有史以来第一个外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are the first outsider. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.56,0:31:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要我早知道了 我才不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I haven't known that, I wouldn't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也会穿得好一点 - 雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And would've dressed better.- Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.05,0:31:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你来的正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey.- It's about time, you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗把吃的都干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul's been hoovering the grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.79,0:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我给你留了些汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I saved you some burgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.20,0:31:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是雪中送炭啊 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good looking out, Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.39,0:31:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 这是赛斯·克里尔沃特 莉亚的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella, this is Seth Clearwater, Leah's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,族群的最新成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newest member of the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.03,0:31:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新的 最好的 最聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newest, bestest, brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.53,0:31:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是速度最慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And slowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来嘛 你爸爸马上就开始了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Your dad's about to start.- Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.14,0:31:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎鲁特族在一开始只是个很小的部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Quileutes have been a small tribe from the beginning…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.14,0:31:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的血液中流淌着魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've always had magic in our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.75,0:31:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是杰出的精神斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were great spirit warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.21,0:31:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够变成强大的狼的变形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}shape shifters, that transform into the powerful wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我们能够吓走敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This enabled us to scare off our enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.84,0:32:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们的部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protect our tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.61,0:32:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天我们的勇士遇到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day our warriors came across.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.35,0:32:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看起来是人类 可是却坚硬如磐石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked like a man, but it was hard like stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.83,0:32:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷似冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cold as ice…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们勇士的尖牙最终让它四分五裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our warriors' sharp teeth, finally tore it apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.92,0:32:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只有火才能将它彻底摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only fire would completely destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.49,0:32:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,族人生活在恐惧之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lived in fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吸血鬼绝不是孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Cold Man was not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.54,0:32:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将仇恨倾泻到整个村庄\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took her vengeance out on the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.61,0:33:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的祖先领袖 塔哈·阿吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our elder chief, Taha Aki,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.26,0:33:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是留下来拯救部落的唯一的精神斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the only spirit warrior left to save the tribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.79,0:33:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他的儿子死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after his son was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.77,0:33:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔哈·阿吉的第三个妻子看出他快输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taha Aki's Third Wife could sees that he would lose…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.57,0:33:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个妻子是普通人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Third Wife was no magical being,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.52,0:33:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有特殊的力量 但是她有\N{\fnArial\fs30}no special powers, but one…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.82,0:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个妻子牺牲自己的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Third Wife's sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.99,0:33:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散了女吸血鬼的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}distracted the Cold Woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.94,0:33:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以让塔哈·阿吉毁灭了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}long enough for Taha Aki to destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.05,0:33:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拯救了部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:34:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着时间的推移 我们的敌人逐一消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over time, our enemies have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.95,0:34:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一种留存了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one remains…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.03,0:34:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cold Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.69,0:34:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当它们靠近 我们的魔力就会苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our magic awakens when they near.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.23,0:34:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就感受到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we sense it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.04,0:34:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液里感到了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}we feel the threat in our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.09,0:34:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难即将来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something terrible is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须有所准备 所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we must all be ready. All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.37,0:34:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.55,0:35:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好 - 是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so…- Yeah, I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.00,0:35:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你找个人喝喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find you someone to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.63,0:35:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好自己不要被杀 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try not to get killed, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.05,0:35:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还需要人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.27,0:35:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,西雅图被恐惧笼罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seattle is in a state of terror…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.69,0:35:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方为急剧增多的谋杀案与失踪案而不解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police are baffled by the escalating murders and disappearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.63,0:35:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们猜测 或许是残暴的新帮派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theories range from a vicious new gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.50,0:35:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是异常活跃的连环杀手犯案\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a wildly active serial killer…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- CNN记者唐·楚白现场报道 - 事情在恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reporting live, Dawn Chubai. CNN. - It's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.53,0:35:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.62,0:35:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个吸血鬼肯定是做不出这种破坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes more than one of our kind to cause the damage they're reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.87,0:35:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们人数很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有章法 惹人注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're undisciplined, conspicuous…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.92,0:35:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是新生儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Newborns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.93,0:35:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 新生的吸血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like new vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.79,0:35:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们变化后的头几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their first few months after they change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.18,0:35:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最难控制的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when we're at our most uncontrollable,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.53,0:36:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因饥渴而疯狂难训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicious, insane with thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.03,0:36:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是在渴盼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.75,0:36:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人训练这些新生儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has trained these newborns,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.34,0:36:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这绝对不是偶然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this isn't random.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.69,0:36:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在制造吸血鬼军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's creating an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们必须去西雅图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now we definitely going to Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.33,0:36:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Army of vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.26,0:36:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是被制造出来战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've been created to fight someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.18,0:36:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是离西雅图最近的部族\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the only clan even close to Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.98,0:36:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它们是从哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardless, of who are they were may,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.15,0:36:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we don't put a stop to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.38,0:36:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Volturi will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.66,0:36:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很诧异他们居然放任不管这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised they've let it go on this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.02,0:36:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们正是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.52,0:36:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在意大利 我读到了埃罗的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Italy, I read Aro's mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.27,0:36:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要我和爱丽丝入伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me and Alice to join him…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道只要我们的家族还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows we'd never choose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as our family is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.33,0:36:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支军队可以替他解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}An army could solve that for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.28,0:36:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻人启事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley Biers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.52,0:36:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 吃晚饭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Did you eat dinner yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.96,0:36:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… no… I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.36,0:37:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小孩儿莱利·比尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kid Riley Biers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.98,0:37:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappeared over a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可怜的父母从那时起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his poor parents been papering Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个贴满了西雅图\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these things ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.28,0:37:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是觉得他们还是放弃了好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they should just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.98,0:37:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果失踪的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't. If it were you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.04,0:37:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会停止找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.22,0:37:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没想好怎么告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to figure out what to tell people…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.58,0:37:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么圣诞不回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I won't be home for Christmases.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我不再拜访他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I won't visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.47,0:37:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们再也见不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they'll never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,几十年后 你认识的人都会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a few decades, everyone you know will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.20,0:37:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.71,0:37:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你如此反对我变成吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so against me becoming like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.37,0:38:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要骗我 肯定还有别的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest with me. There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.19,0:38:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你所做的选择会带来的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the consequences, of this choice you're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.10,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lived through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.20,0:38:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再让你去受这个罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to let you suffer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.56,0:38:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总相信我是有灵魂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe I have a soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.47,0:38:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.62,0:38:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,之所以冒险同意你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to risk yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了永远不会失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for the sake of never having to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.72,0:38:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我做过最自私的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the most selfish thing I'll ever do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.18,0:38:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 你可能是怕我会变得太不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, maybe you were afraid that I'll be too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.26,0:38:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样 我不会再\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike. I won't be,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.47,0:38:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know… warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.51,0:38:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且气味也会不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And won't smell the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.46,0:39:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都是我的贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always be my Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.59,0:39:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的贝拉 坚强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Bella, just less fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.01,0:39:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这里好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, it's so pretty here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.09,0:39:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝在策划一个盛大的毕业舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Alice is planning a big graduation party,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也被邀请了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you're invited to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.98,0:40:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I figured that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.42,0:40:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.49,0:40:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实想用不同的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to do this differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.53,0:40:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,更愉悦的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.44,0:40:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今 没有那么多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, I'm out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.86,0:40:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须知道真相 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to hear the truth, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.05,0:40:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看清你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand all your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.73,0:40:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.24,0:40:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.05,0:40:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你选择的是我 而不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to choose me, instead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.77,0:40:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.03,0:40:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我对你没有那种感觉 - 我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't feel that way for you.- I don't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What don't you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.09,0:40:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.17,0:41:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我还有别的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel something else for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.48,0:41:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你不愿意承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just won't admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.02,0:41:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不会放弃的 我要争取你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not giving up. I'm gonna fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.61,0:41:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你的心脏停止跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until your heart stops beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你倒不会争取太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you're not gonna have to fight for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.57,0:41:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你急着改变是因为你害怕自己会改变想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're rushing into it because you're afraid you'll change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.99,0:41:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.21,0:41:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟了我不需要改变 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have to change for me, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.93,0:41:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用跟任何人永别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or say goodbye to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你的比他更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you more than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.72,0:41:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他甚至都不能随心所欲地吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he probably can't even kiss you without hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.47,0:41:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.86,0:41:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,血肉之躯和温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flesh and blood and warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.30,0:42:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.06,0:42:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再敢乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever touch her against her will again!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.53,0:42:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.19,0:42:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本就不确定自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not sure what she wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.52,0:42:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这样 - 好 那我给你个提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this!- Well, let me give you a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.97,0:42:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她把话说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for her to say the words!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.43,0:42:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 就好像她真有话要说一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine! And she will!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.06,0:42:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob. Just go, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.10,0:42:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了小伙们 别打 停一停 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy guys, easy. Let's take it down a notch. Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.63,0:42:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.67,0:42:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吻了贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kissed Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.36,0:42:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的手还受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she broke her hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.97,0:42:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我脸弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}punching my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.18,0:42:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.53,0:42:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭伤而已 很快就会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a sprain, should heal fairly quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.87,0:43:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一边走路一边嚼口香糖了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to walk and chew gum at the same time again, Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.04,0:43:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我揍了狼人的脸 - 坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I punched a werewolf in the face. - Bad ass…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.14,0:43:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是个难缠的新生儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be one tough little newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.34,0:43:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付你是没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough enough to take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.32,0:43:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.63,0:43:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 有线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, any Leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.06,0:43:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有入侵者的迹象 但维多利亚不断出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of the intruder. But Victoria continues to make appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.95,0:43:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,找别人谈论成为新生儿的喜悦去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go blather to someone else about the joys of becoming a newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.95,0:43:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 罗莎莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Rosalie…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.67,0:43:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白我做了什么让你这么恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what I did, to make you hate me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.09,0:43:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.36,0:44:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是很喜欢你 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't particularly like you, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.86,0:44:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 我嫉妒你 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella, I envy you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.48,0:44:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太荒谬了 - 一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's ridiculous. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.01,0:44:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有选择 我当初没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a choice. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.14,0:44:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没有 但你有 而你却选错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us did. But you do, and you're choosing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.85,0:44:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎作为人类的你生活有多凄惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how miserable your human life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.49,0:44:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活不凄惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is not miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.34,0:44:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活不完美 但没人的生活是完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not perfect, but nobody's life is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.10,0:44:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经的生活是 绝对的完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine was. Absolutely perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.00,0:44:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在还希望得到那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything as I still wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.12,0:44:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚 有一所大房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be married, With a nice house and.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.93,0:44:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,丈夫会在我回家时吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a husband…to kiss me when he came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.33,0:44:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.12,0:45:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊斯·金是当时镇上最合适的单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royce King was the most eligible bachelor in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他知之甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.80,0:45:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我那么年轻 我爱上的只是爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was young. I was in love with the idea of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.32,0:45:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生命中的最后一天 我很晚才离开朋友家\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the last night of my life, I left a friend's house late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我快到家时 - 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't far from home. - Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.25,0:45:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗莎 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rose! Come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.25,0:45:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.49,0:45:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我们一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come over here. We've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.87,0:45:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.77,0:45:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royce.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.13,0:45:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.95,0:45:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她多可爱啊 约翰 我告诉过你她长得很俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't she lovely, John? I told you she was a looker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.17,0:45:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她穿着那么多衣服 很难说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to say with all those clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.37,0:45:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 罗莎 不如我们脱掉几层\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Rose? Why don't we take off a few layers?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.66,0:45:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.10,0:45:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天等你清醒了 我们再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow. Sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.32,0:45:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你以为你能去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.86,0:46:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 不要 放开我 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Just stop it! Let go! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.33,0:46:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回来 照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comeback! Hey, you'll do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.33,0:46:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我丢在大街上 以为我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left me in the street, thinking I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.76,0:46:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我倒希望自己死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I wanted to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.33,0:46:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔发现了我 他闻到了血的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle found me, he smelled all the blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.07,0:46:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他以为他是在救我 - 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thought he was helping me. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还是报了仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my revenge on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.34,0:46:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.34,0:46:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊斯留在最后 这样他可以知道我要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved Royce for last, so he'd know I was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.76,0:46:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当年有些戏剧化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a little theatrical back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.78,0:47:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到埃美特后情况就好些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things got better after I found Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.30,0:47:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们永远都只能是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll always be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰冷的 永远无法改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frozen, never moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.99,0:47:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最怀念的 无尽的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I miss the most, the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.80,0:47:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在某处的门廊上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting on a front porch somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.60,0:47:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃美特坐在我身边 头发花白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emmett gray haired by my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.30,0:47:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围还有我们的孙子孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by our grandchildren,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.24,0:47:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的笑声\N{\fnArial\fs30}their laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.97,0:47:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 那是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.76,0:47:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想要的永远只有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's nothing I'll ever gonna want, more…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.41,0:47:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}than Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.70,0:47:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.55,0:48:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你被转变之后 有样东西你会更想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you've been changed, there's one thing you'll want more…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.88,0:48:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为之杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing you'll kill for…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.14,0:48:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.36,0:48:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过什么 低调行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say, about low profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.11,0:48:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.08,0:48:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比你我任何一个都强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something… Bigger than any of us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.57,0:48:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.69,0:48:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}control yourselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.87,0:48:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就只有死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.32,0:48:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,事已至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.36,0:49:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}clean up after yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.11,0:49:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经吸引了太多的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've already drawn too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.47,0:49:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的无所作为也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So has our "Inaction".
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.75,0:49:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人也许已经开始质疑沃尔图里家族的效率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others may begin to question the Volturi's effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.27,0:49:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,随他们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.28,0:49:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该咨询下埃罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should consult with Aro.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃罗的抉择已经被监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aro's decisions are being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.95,0:49:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须由我们决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.93,0:49:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就做出抉择吧 是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then decide sister. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.13,0:49:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.62,0:49:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 我们让他们完成自己的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either we let them do what they were created for…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.69,0:50:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 我们消灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we end them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.44,0:50:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抉择啊抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decisions, decisions…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.10,0:50:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五岁时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were five,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.21,0:50:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们问我们长大后想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}they asked us what we wanted to be when we grew up…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.54,0:50:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的回答是宇航员 总统之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our answers were things like astronaut, president…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.24,0:50:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者以我来说 一位公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in my case, a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.01,0:50:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们十岁时 他们又问一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were ten, they asked again,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.84,0:50:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回答 摇滚明星 牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we answered, rock star, cowboy,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.60,0:50:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者以我来说 金牌得主\N{\fnArial\fs30}or in my case, a gold medalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.44,0:50:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在我们长大了 他们想要真正的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that we've grown up, they want a serious answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.91,0:50:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about this…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.38,0:50:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁他妈知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}who the hell knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.54,0:50:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是做出艰难而仓促决定的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the time to make hard and fast decisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.78,0:50:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是犯错误的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the time to make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.42,0:50:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,登上错误的列车 困在某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the wrong train and get stuck somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.55,0:50:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠入爱河 一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall in love, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.62,0:51:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,主修哲学 因为那是最没前途的专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major in philosophy, because there's no way to make a career out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变主意 再反悔 因为没有什么是永恒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change your mind, and change it again, because nothing is permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.51,0:51:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 尽可能地去犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, make as many mistakes as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.80,0:51:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样 有一天 当他们问我们想做什么时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, someday, when they ask what we wanna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.97,0:51:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要再猜测 因为已经了然于心\N{\fnArial\fs30}we won't have to guess. We'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.30,0:51:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.12,0:51:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我的演讲怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you think of my speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.60,0:51:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太像广告 励志书籍之类的吗 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too easy-breezy, too self-helpful? You may admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 你干得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you pretty much nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.47,0:52:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天生就是做领袖的料 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I was born to lead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.10,0:52:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这首歌 去跳舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. I love this song, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.50,0:52:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干什么 - 你邀请我来的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - You invited me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.02,0:52:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的右勾拳就那么无力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was my right hook too subtle for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.64,0:52:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我告诉你不要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was me uninviting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.82,0:52:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bella. I'm sorry… about, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.89,0:52:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吻 还有你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kiss and your hand…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.23,0:52:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以说是兽性作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd blame it on the whole inner animal thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.84,0:52:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实只是我 混蛋的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was really just… me. Being an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.46,0:52:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.56,0:52:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了点东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.65,0:53:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业礼物 我自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A graduation present. I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.67,0:53:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲手做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… You made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.05,0:53:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really pretty. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.88,0:53:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱丽丝 你看到什么了 - 决定已经作出\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alice, what did you see? - The decision's been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.40,0:53:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 你们不去西雅图了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - You're not going to Seattle?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.77,0:53:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.75,0:53:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝这里来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.20,0:53:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,四天后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be here in four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.85,0:53:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是一场恶战\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could turn into a blood bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.10,0:53:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁指使的 - 没看到认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's behind it? - I didn't see anyone I recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.22,0:53:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.33,0:53:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他 他是本地人 莱利·比尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know his face. He's local, Riley Biers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.53,0:53:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他挑起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't start this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.64,0:53:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是谁 都只是在暗处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did is staying out of the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.08,0:53:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们利用了你预知能力的盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be playing with the blind spots in your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 军队已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, the army is coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.05,0:54:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人数不足以保护这个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there aren't enough of us to protect the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.39,0:54:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up! What damn army?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.07,0:54:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新生儿 吸血鬼 - 他们的目标是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Newborns. Our kind. - What are they after?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.64,0:54:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在辨识贝拉的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were passing around Bella's scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.57,0:54:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件红衬衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}A red blouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.21,0:54:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的目标是贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're after Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.30,0:54:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么意思 - 意味着一场恶战\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell does this mean? - It means an ugly fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.46,0:54:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}With lives lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.85,0:54:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.55,0:54:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们加入 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're in. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.06,0:54:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会被杀的 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get yourselves killed, noway.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.20,0:54:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是在征求许可 - 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't asking for permission. - Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.01,0:54:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你有更多的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means more protection for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.91,0:54:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 你觉得山姆愿意达成共识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob. Do you believe Sam will agree to… an understanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.33,0:54:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们能杀掉几只吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we get to kill some vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.15,0:54:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贾斯帕 - 他们可以增加我们的胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jasper? - They'll give us the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.49,0:54:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些新生儿都不知道他们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the newborns won't know they even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.17,0:54:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是我们的优势 - 我们需要协调一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That'll give us an edge. - We'll need to coordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.75,0:55:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 他们会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle, they'll gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.01,0:55:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都需要训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all need some training.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.44,0:55:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,与新生儿作战需要学习贾斯帕的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting newborns requires knowledge that Jasper has.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.98,0:55:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.35,0:55:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 时间地点你定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Name the time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.61,0:55:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.20,0:55:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你自己卷进了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're getting yourself in to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.90,0:55:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.88,0:55:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么做 你应该高兴才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we do. You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.19,0:55:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们 并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us, working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.22,0:55:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你希望我们和睦相处的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who wanted us to get along, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.40,0:55:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.72,0:55:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是毕业礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a graduation present.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.06,0:56:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是信任我们 他们应该以人形现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't trust us enough to be in their human forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.87,0:56:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 那就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came. That's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.28,0:56:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来做翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you translate?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.22,0:56:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.54,0:56:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.14,0:56:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕有和新生儿打交道的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper has experience with newborns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.73,0:56:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会教我们如何击败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll teach us how to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.34,0:56:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想知道新生儿和我们有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to know how the "Newborns" Is differ from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.50,0:56:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比我们要强壮许多倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a great deal stronger than us,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.13,0:56:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自己的血液还残留在身体组织里\N{\fnArial\fs30}because their own human blood lingers in their tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.79,0:57:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼的能力在转变后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kind is never more physically powerful…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.55,0:57:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,最先几个月最厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}than in our first several months of this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.26,0:57:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莱尔说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlisle's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.42,0:57:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才会诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they are created.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.36,0:57:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支新生儿大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}A newborn army,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.17,0:57:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要像人类军队那样需要几千人\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't need thousands like a human army.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.98,0:57:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人类军队可以阻挡他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no human army could stand against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.22,0:57:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两件事需要记住 第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two most important things to remember are, first…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.30,0:57:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不要让他们的胳膊环住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let them get their arms around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.20,0:57:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以瞬间将你压碎 第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll crush you instantly. The second…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.68,0:57:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要想一击毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never go for the obvious kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.96,0:57:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就等着你那么做 你只会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be expecting that. And you will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.60,0:57:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃美特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emmett?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.02,0:57:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开手脚 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't hold back. - Not in my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.70,0:58:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不要放松警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never lose focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.36,0:58:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.57,0:58:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要轻视你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never turn your back on your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.32,0:59:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中的某些人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you, are gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.43,0:59:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至会死 都因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you could get killed, because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.86,0:59:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候会比这个激烈一百倍 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a hundred times worse than this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.41,1:00:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.02,1:00:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.54,1:00:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定没有我能帮忙的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure, there's nothing I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.51,1:00:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你出现就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.45,1:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的味道会分散新生儿的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}your scent will distract the newborns.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.13,1:00:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的猎杀本性会占上风 把他们逼疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their hunting instinct will take over, drive them crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.63,1:00:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很高兴知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.86,1:00:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.44,1:00:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know so much about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.12,1:00:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成长的经历跟我的兄弟姐妹不大一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have quite the same upbringing as my adopted siblings.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.50,1:00:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些咬痕跟我的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bites are like mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.97,1:00:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗时留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle scars.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.08,1:00:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在南方军接受的所有训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the training the Confederate Army gave me…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.85,1:01:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在新生儿面前都是无用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was useless against the newborns.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.17,1:01:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是没输过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, I never lost a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.95,1:01:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是南北战争时的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has happened during the civil war?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.92,1:01:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是德州骑兵最年轻的少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the youngest major in the Texas cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.81,1:01:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从未见识过一场真正的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All without having seen any real battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.65,1:01:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.63,1:01:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我遇到了一位真正的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I met a certain immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.60,1:01:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.84,1:01:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我刚刚疏散了一处的妇孺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was riding back to Galveston…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.08,1:01:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,正骑马赶回加尔维斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}after evacuating a column of women and children.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw her…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.11,1:01:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就向她提供救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I immediately offered her my aid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.44,1:01:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱 一位军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely. And an officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.43,1:02:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好还是你来 玛利亚 我一开始就停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better do it, Maria. I can never stop once I've started.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.57,1:02:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕·维特洛克少校 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Jasper Whitlock, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.28,1:02:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你能幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.21,1:02:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我来说有很大的用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You maybe of a great use to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.27,1:02:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚在制造一支军队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria was creating an army?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.43,1:02:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在南方 那很常见\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were very common in the South.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.88,1:02:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来争夺领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cost a brutal battles for territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.32,1:02:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛利亚每次都胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria won them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.17,1:02:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很聪明 又小心 而且她有了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was smart, careful. And she had me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.62,1:02:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她的副官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the second in command.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.47,1:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制情绪的能力很合她的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}My abilities to control emotions served her well.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.22,1:02:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为她训练新生儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trained her newborns.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.28,1:02:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从不让新生儿活过第一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}An endless occupation since.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.85,1:02:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也成了一份无期限的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}she never let them live beyond their first year.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.70,1:03:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作也包括清理他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my job to dispose of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.70,1:03:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以感受到他们的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel everything they felt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.87,1:03:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为玛利亚和我之间的就是爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought what Maria and I had was love.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.28,1:03:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只是她的木偶 她控制一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was her puppet. She pulled the strings.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.15,1:03:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还有别的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know there was another way…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.49,1:03:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我遇见爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I found Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.03,1:03:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然她现在也知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she'd seen me coming, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.77,1:04:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我等了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept me waiting long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.99,1:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我致以歉意 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.62,1:04:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有遇见爱丽丝 真不知道我会变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'd have become without her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不用过那样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never have to be that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.12,1:05:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.98,1:05:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intruder…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.97,1:05:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,新生吸血鬼军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The newborn army.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.01,1:05:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是她的玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all her puppets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.53,1:05:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.82,1:05:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她造军队 爱丽丝会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice would've seen if she wanted to make an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.35,1:05:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她把他们藏起来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she's hiding behind them,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.42,1:05:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且让另外一个人控制军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's letting someone else decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.27,1:06:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the army.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.46,1:06:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在你们为我冒险的时候躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna hide, while you're taking all the risks for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.81,1:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果此事与维多利亚有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's Victoria involved…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.81,1:06:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须让你远离战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to keep you as far away from the fight as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.56,1:06:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯帕说我可能会帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper said that I could be of help.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.62,1:06:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.93,1:06:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有狼人的帮助会赢得很轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the wolves in this, it's an easy win.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.84,1:06:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没什么可做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us, aren't gonna have enough to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.43,1:06:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 到底是情况危险 我必须躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, either it's so dangerous that I have to hide…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.69,1:06:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是取胜很容易 以至于你们无所事事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's so easy, that you're gonna be side blind, which is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.89,1:06:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说很危险 对我们来说很轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous for you. It's easy for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.57,1:06:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们分开就会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's dangerous for us to be apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.68,1:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要证明几次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times we have to prove that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.31,1:06:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会担心 担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be worrying. You'll be worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.49,1:06:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都会恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we"ll both feel more horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.57,1:06:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.98,1:06:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.53,1:06:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们必须分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we've got to stay away together.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.94,1:07:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你在我和你的家庭之间做选择 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't make you choose between me and your family, it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.90,1:07:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你的唯一办法就是和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way I can protect you, is to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.45,1:07:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没练习打斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not fighting?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.29,1:07:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是拉伤肌肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you pull a muscle or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.34,1:07:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是为了我 - 管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's doing it for me. Okay? - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.86,1:07:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.15,1:07:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方作为战场对我们十分有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This field will give us an advantage in battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.57,1:07:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用贝拉的气味吸引那些新生吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to lure the newborns with Bella's scent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.89,1:07:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须在这地方结束战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs to end here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.51,1:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华和我去营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward and I are going on a campsite.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.30,1:07:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他和我一起 他们还是能闻到我的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if he carries me, they'll still pick up our scents.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.72,1:07:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的气味实在很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stench, however, is revolting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.59,1:07:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你是在逃避气味的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you really don't want to start comparing stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.87,1:07:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是说 如果是你带着我 你的气味会遮住我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he means, is that your scent will mask mine if you carry me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.27,1:07:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.90,1:07:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.63,1:07:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.74,1:07:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会接近他的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't want to get anywhere near his… odor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.61,1:07:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 试验一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's just try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.88,1:07:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 香水狼 来吧 - 跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eau de wolf, comin' up. - Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.33,1:08:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想让我袖手旁观吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna ask me to sit out the fight, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.12,1:08:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是你不在乎我的安全问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't you care about my safety?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.66,1:08:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然在意 但是你会拒绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I care, but you'd say no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.47,1:08:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以无论如何我没的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I won't have a choice anyways.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我让山姆成为领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I let Sam be alpha male.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.18,1:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得听从他的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to live with the shots he calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.34,1:08:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你让山姆成为领袖开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you let Sam be alpha?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.89,1:08:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想群居 更不用说当他们的领袖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to be in a pack, let alone be it's their leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雅各布领袖 - 退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chief Jacob. - Opted out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.31,1:08:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每个选择都会有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every choice has it's consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.29,1:08:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一些更有意义的选择 - 那就别做选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some more than others. - Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.34,1:08:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有选择 但你必须接受我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody makes choices, you gonna have to accept mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.38,1:08:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以同时爱上多个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can love more than one person at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.70,1:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾见过 就像山姆 艾米粒和莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it, with Sam, Emily, and Leah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.98,1:09:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是狼人 我不会留下烙印 - 这跟烙印没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not a wolf, I can't imprint. - It has nothing to do with imprinting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.96,1:09:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和对某人的感觉有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to do with… feeling something for somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.25,1:09:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你对我有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you feel something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.03,1:09:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到我对你的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sense how I make you feel…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.53,1:09:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,体会到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Physically.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.96,1:09:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make you nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.30,1:09:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.81,1:09:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.89,1:09:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你要求 我答应过不再吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised I wouldn't kiss you again until you asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.87,1:09:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得一直遵守承诺了 领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be keeping that promise for a while, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.73,1:09:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到的只是狼的臭味 没有贝拉的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I picked up was wolf stench. No Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.41,1:09:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样能行 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This will work. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.36,1:10:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱丽丝 别见外 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Alice. Don't be a stranger. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.86,1:10:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参加战斗的借口已经搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your alibi for the battle is all arranged.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.94,1:10:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.32,1:10:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你爸爸我们全家周末要去野营\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told your father that our whole family's going camping this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.14,1:10:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要在我家住一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and I are having a sleep over at my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正查理要去钓鱼 - 查理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charlie is going fishing anyway. - Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.35,1:10:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经是一路人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys run for the same basis now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.34,1:10:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, he likes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.21,1:10:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 今晚只有你和爱德华在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you and Edward will have the house to yourself tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.99,1:10:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.75,1:10:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全要出去打猎 为战斗补充体能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going hunting, powering up for the battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.58,1:10:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来个三明治吗 - 我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Do you want a sandwich? - No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.23,1:10:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他姐姐 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the sister… I like.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.37,1:10:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 她人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice. Yeah, she's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.21,1:11:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad. I was wondering…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.67,1:11:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟妈妈离婚后 为什么不再找一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you get remarried, after Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.21,1:11:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.12,1:11:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还没遇到对的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I still haven't met the right gal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.53,1:11:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you just…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.58,1:11:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你为了传统理念放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you gave up on the whole institution of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.00,1:11:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.18,1:11:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你想过有何价值吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you think there's any value in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.17,1:11:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻有其价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, marriage has value.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.24,1:11:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大后 成熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're older. Much older.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.33,1:11:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你妈妈那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.37,1:11:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,离婚后似乎过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seem to work out fine for her the second time round.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.96,1:11:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下半生 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Later in life. - Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.54,1:11:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不想结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You definitely don't wanna have to get married,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.08,1:12:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不是很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you weren't… careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.92,1:12:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.09,1:12:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你了解我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.38,1:12:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事你需要好好想想 如果你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's… Things, that you need to think about it, if you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.41,1:12:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们身体很亲密的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you gonna be… physically intimate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.13,1:12:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 今天谈话到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't… until we've enough of "The Talk".
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.98,1:12:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不说这个吗 - 我也很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you just quit. - It's just as embarrassing for me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.54,1:12:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就跟你一样尴尬 - 我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- as it is for you. - I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.79,1:12:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打断 因为妈妈十年前离开的太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't bother, 'cause Mom beat you too early ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.31,1:12:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年前你也没有男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you didn't have a boyfriend ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.35,1:12:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure things work the same way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.07,1:12:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. So…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.59,1:12:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要做些防护措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are… taking precautions, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.18,1:12:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了爸爸 请别担心那事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, dad. Please just don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.18,1:12:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华是个保守派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward is… old school.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.40,1:12:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,保守派 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old school, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.94,1:12:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 某个东西的遗传基因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? Like a code for something?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.27,1:12:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. Dad…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.10,1:12:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a virgin!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.00,1:12:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧 谈得非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go. Glad we covered that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.62,1:12:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.03,1:13:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgin…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.02,1:13:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有点儿喜欢爱德华了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liking Edward a little bit more now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.21,1:13:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面干什么呢 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here outside? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.69,1:13:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.62,1:13:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎把这个送给你 才算公平一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems the only fair, that I'd be represented as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.70,1:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.84,1:13:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.29,1:14:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一张床呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.05,1:14:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你需要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might need one to sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.81,1:14:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个充气垫就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think an air mattress would've sufficed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.62,1:14:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在这样不好吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is too much? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.94,1:14:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这样很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.23,1:14:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.00,1:14:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.95,1:14:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻对你来说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, marriage is the condition for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.10,1:14:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我变成你族人的条件 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to change me yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.39,1:14:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.14,1:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我想谈谈我的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I want to negotiate my own condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.40,1:14:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉听尊便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you want, It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.84,1:14:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you promise?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.86,1:14:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.09,1:15:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella… no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.80,1:15:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过想让我经历作为人类的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've said that you wanted me to have every human experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.96,1:15:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你有伤害的就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the ones that support risk killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.36,1:15:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会伤害我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.59,1:15:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 一旦我转化后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone says, once I'm changed…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.32,1:15:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做的事就只有杀了城里所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all I'm gonna want is to slaughter the whole town.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.58,1:15:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情况不会持续太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That part doesn't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.06,1:15:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.99,1:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我没有变 但我还是想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I'm still me. While I still want you this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.04,1:15:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.56,1:15:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try… Just try.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.91,1:15:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去个可笑奢华的大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go to some ridiculously expensive college.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.81,1:15:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让你给我买辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let you buy me a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.41,1:15:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会嫁给你 就试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll marry you, just try.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.16,1:16:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把衣服脱下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to take your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.83,1:16:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不想做吗 - 今晚不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to do that part? - Not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.76,1:17:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我是说 你不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I mean, you don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.40,1:17:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.20,1:17:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.35,1:17:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想先结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be married to you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.49,1:17:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真让我觉得 我是个坏女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really make me feel like I'm some sort of like a villain trying…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.06,1:17:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走你的贞操之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}steal your virtue or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.48,1:17:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是担心我的贞操\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my virtue I'm concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.93,1:17:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.04,1:17:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个原则 我想把持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one rule, I wanna leave unbroken.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.85,1:17:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂不再拥有这个原则 但我想让你拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be too late for my soul, but I will protect yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.37,1:17:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这不是个现代观念 - 真不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it's not a modern notion. - It's not modern.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.16,1:17:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古代的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ancient.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.35,1:18:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自一个不同的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from a different era.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.70,1:18:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事并非如此复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were… a lot less complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.65,1:18:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那时我遇见你 我会向你求爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I met you back then, I would've courted to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.32,1:18:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会牵手漫步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have taken chaperoned strolls,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.43,1:18:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者在走廊里喝凉茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}or had iced tea on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.44,1:18:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会偷吻你一两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have stolen a kiss or two.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.77,1:18:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 只会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, only…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.74,1:18:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在征得你父亲的同意之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after asking your father's permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.94,1:18:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会单腿下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've got down on one knee.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.60,1:18:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会献上一枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would presented you with a ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.54,1:19:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这曾是我母亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my mother's.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.77,1:19:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉·斯旺 我保证会时时刻刻爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabella Swan. I promise to love you, every moment forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.05,1:19:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有此殊荣娶你为妻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would you do me the extraordinary honor of marrying me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.60,1:19:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.96,1:19:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不跟我们一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.41,1:20:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是千钧一发的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be a last minute decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.94,1:20:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.18,1:20:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡伦一家有神奇的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cullens have powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.48,1:20:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别低估了他们 莱利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't underestimate them, Riley.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.72,1:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.26,1:20:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they'll be able to…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.36,1:20:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,预见你每一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}anticipate your every move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.74,1:20:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友这么说的吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- According to your friend. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.97,1:20:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死去的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dead friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.65,1:20:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦发现了他们的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laurent found out about the things they could do,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.89,1:20:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.44,1:20:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我知道得太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not before he told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.05,1:20:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.81,1:20:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.67,1:20:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is supposed to be…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.31,1:20:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡伦家族的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cullen territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.44,1:21:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们已经侵入 却仍未见他们的踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've been tearing it up and I've never even seen them here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.45,1:21:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.40,1:21:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用生命爱你 我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my life. I'm just saying that…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.74,1:21:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了我们可以不再挨饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for us. So that we can feed,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.32,1:21:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心他们的报复 再也不用害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without their retaliation. Can't live in fear anymore,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.29,1:21:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不用坐以待毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for them to attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.78,1:21:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.70,1:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就去结束卡伦家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to end the Cullen clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.44,1:21:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.27,1:21:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太爱你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. So much.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.99,1:22:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going overboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.03,1:22:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只能做这些 我想坚持到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is all I can contribute, I want to be thorough.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.90,1:22:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,新生吸血鬼会为此而疯狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The newborns will be frantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.14,1:22:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿 别难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Okay. Don't make yourself uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.67,1:22:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再发火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't bother me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.11,1:22:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从何时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.79,1:22:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从以为你死了之后的24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I spent 24 hours thinking you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.39,1:22:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没带戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wearing your ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.16,1:22:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't want to risk losing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.36,1:22:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是怕雅各布看见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or risk Jacob seeing it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.41,1:22:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该等等再告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should wait to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.18,1:22:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少等这场战斗之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, at least till after the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.97,1:22:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是否有别的想法 - 不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you're having second thoughts… - I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.70,1:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想让他分神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want him to have a clear head.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.51,1:22:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁分神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose head is unclear?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.41,1:23:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.06,1:23:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝说风暴要来临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice says there's a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.11,1:23:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到 我们应该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can feel it. We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.23,1:23:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.05,1:23:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something up?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.26,1:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群吸血鬼想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of vampires trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.95,1:23:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老调重弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old, same old.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.00,1:24:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.65,1:24:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雪就要来了 你快回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get back before the storm hits.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.58,1:24:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.40,1:24:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你和狼群取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need my connection to the pack,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.69,1:24:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,密切关注任何风吹草动\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep tabs on what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.17,1:25:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不参加战斗了 - 明早赛斯会来接我的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not going to fight? - Seth will spell me in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.04,1:25:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直对这个安排耿耿于怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not happy about missing the action,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.90,1:25:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这能保证他平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it'll keep him out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.82,1:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.59,1:25:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该找个海拔低一点的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have chosen a site lower down.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.76,1:25:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, It's fine. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.36,1:25:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.64,1:25:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙齿打架的声音吵得我根本睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep with all that teeth chattering going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.25,1:25:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.90,1:26:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想她把脚都冻掉了 你得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may need her toes someday. And let's face it…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.80,1:26:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hotter than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.13,1:26:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hand off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.46,1:26:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off her!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.76,1:26:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.35,1:26:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她病了 你看着办\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gets sick, it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.17,1:26:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冻僵了 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why! You're freezing, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 马上就能暖起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, You'll warm up soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.51,1:26:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你脱掉衣服能暖得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster if you took your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.36,1:26:55.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 雅各 - 《幸存者101》里说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake. - Survival one oh one.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.51,1:27:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能试着控制下你的思绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you, at least attempt to control your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.19,1:27:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真被我惹毛了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really get under that ice cold skin of yours, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.18,1:27:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.35,1:27:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在怀疑她对你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doubting her feelings for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.61,1:27:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.60,1:27:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷窥我的想法 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So picking through my brain's okay,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.47,1:27:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可让我猜你的心思 还是省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but letting me into yours, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.25,1:27:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.01,1:28:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道她爱你 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know she's in love with you. - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.40,1:28:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她也爱着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's in love with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.01,1:28:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是不愿承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just won't admit it to herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.55,1:28:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么想我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you if you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.45,1:28:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.11,1:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是她选择了我 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If she chooses me… - She won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.39,1:28:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说当初\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.59,1:28:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you try to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.46,1:28:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an intriguing idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.45,1:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不会 我不会那样伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no. I couldn't hurt her like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.67,1:28:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想把她变成和你一样的嗜血恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you'd just turn her into a bloodsucking demon like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.27,1:28:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想 从来都没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want that. I never wanted that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.79,1:28:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就阻止她 - 我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So stop her. - I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.88,1:28:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我离开了她 - 可你回来得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I left. - But you gave up too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.77,1:29:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你再多消失半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd stayed away another six months,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.36,1:29:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让她很幸福 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've made her happy. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.10,1:29:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to consider…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.72,1:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能比你更适合她\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I might be better for her than you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.47,1:29:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have considered that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.36,1:29:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can protect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.03,1:29:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让她过上正常的人类生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can give her a life, a human life.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.57,1:29:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我对她最大的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I want for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.17,1:29:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.99,1:29:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再逼迫她做任何事情 再也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to force her into anything, ever again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.82,1:29:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次让我们两个都差点送了命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time I tried, it almost killed us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.64,1:29:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.28,1:29:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候 当你认为她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you thought she was gone…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.89,1:29:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失去她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'd lost her…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.13,1:30:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you… cope?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.19,1:30:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're no words.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.94,1:30:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不会让任何人和我分担这份痛苦 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't wash it on anyone, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.04,1:30:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来奇怪 不过我挺高兴你能在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might sound odd, but I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.27,1:30:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty neat.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.34,1:30:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起杀了你 我更希望她温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I'd love to kill you, I'm glad she's warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.60,1:30:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不是天生的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we weren't natural enemies…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.00,1:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也不一直非要剥夺我存在的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you weren't trying to steal my reason for existing…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.55,1:30:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might actually like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.73,1:30:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.53,1:30:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想吸干我深爱的女孩的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't planning on sucking the life out of the girl I love,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.67,1:30:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.16,1:31:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那我也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… Not even then.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.50,1:31:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还能改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she could still change her mind, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.60,1:31:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.98,1:31:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Hi, Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.96,1:31:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布去哪了 他已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jacob? Did he already…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.71,1:31:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.63,1:31:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走之前要检查森林里是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's checking to see if the woods are clear before he goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.34,1:32:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的事 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry about last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.77,1:32:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该理解你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have been easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.40,1:32:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚绝不会进入我十大最爱夜晚榜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It definitely won't make my list of top ten favorite evenings.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.44,1:32:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有个榜单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a list?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.93,1:32:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个和你共度的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ten I spent with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.89,1:32:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一名就是你同意求婚的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one is when you said you'd marry me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.54,1:32:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡伦夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.24,1:32:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经21世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the twenty-first century,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.25,1:32:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想保留我的姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanna hyphenate my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.92,1:32:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要嫁给他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're marrying him?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.33,1:32:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.74,1:32:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew he was listening?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.27,1:32:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserves to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.66,1:32:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雅各 等等 - 贝拉 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake, stop! - Bella, let him…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.12,1:32:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.50,1:32:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.37,1:32:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雅各 我求你 - 我累了 非常累\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake, please! - I'm done! I'm so done!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能为你做些什么 - 你什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can I do? - You can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.80,1:33:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我能 下去和那些魔鬼拼个你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can. By going out there and killing something.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.53,1:33:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你镇静一下 别冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You're not thinking clearly, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.80,1:33:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我死了 你就不用左右为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll get my self killed and make it simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.05,1:33:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 雅各 别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Just, Jake… Stay!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.47,1:33:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.55,1:33:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个充分的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.51,1:33:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不想失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't wanna lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.01,1:33:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够充分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.65,1:33:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're too important.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.10,1:33:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不够充分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.87,1:33:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.75,1:33:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.34,1:33:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.52,1:34:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的初吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should have been our first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.87,1:34:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.17,1:34:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.74,1:35:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.52,1:35:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 可雅各布想得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But Jacob's thoughts are very loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.53,1:35:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.06,1:35:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.00,1:35:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you more.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.45,1:35:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.42,1:35:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.06,1:36:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob just got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.80,1:37:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.82,1:38:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.17,1:38:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在附近 我能听到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's close. I can hear her thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.67,1:38:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seth, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.97,1:38:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道我们不在那 她闻到了我的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew we weren't there, but she caught my scent.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.60,1:38:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道你一定跟我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew you'd be with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.45,1:38:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.55,1:38:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.35,1:38:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱利 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley… Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.49,1:38:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚在利用你 来分散我的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria's just using you, to distract me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.27,1:38:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she knows I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.46,1:38:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 她还很高兴之后你就不会再纠缠她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, she'll be glad she doesn't have to deal with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.83,1:38:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的 莱利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen, Riley.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.13,1:38:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过他读心的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you about their mind tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.41,1:39:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能读到她的想法 我知道她怎么想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read her mind, so I know what she thinks of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.63,1:39:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.37,1:39:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她创造你和军队 只为给她的的真爱詹姆斯报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only created you and this army to avenge her true mate, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.27,1:39:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是她真正在乎的 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing she cares about. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.94,1:39:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱的只有你 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only you. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.91,1:39:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.33,1:39:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生长在福克斯 你熟悉地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from Forks, you know the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.69,1:39:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是她选择你的真正原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason she chose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.16,1:39:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.53,1:39:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.75,1:39:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要信他的挑拨离间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him do this to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.91,1:39:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.58,1:40:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.73,1:40:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑了就再也没有机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get another chance like this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.41,1:40:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要她性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want her!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.61,1:40:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我也感受丧失爱人的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to feel the pain you felt when I killed James.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.99,1:40:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像当我把詹姆斯大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I tore him to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.14,1:40:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抽筋扒皮 挫骨扬灰时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I turned him into ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.06,1:40:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感受的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I turned him into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.12,1:42:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.45,1:42:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.68,1:43:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有情况吗 - 爱丽丝要我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something's wrong. - Alice needs us to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.50,1:43:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.54,1:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多久 - 几分钟 大概十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long? - A few minutes. Maybe ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.84,1:43:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼群必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pack needs to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.96,1:43:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族可不会喜欢和狼人的休战协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Volturi won't honor a truce with the werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.73,1:43:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉亚 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.05,1:44:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.78,1:44:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 坚持住 卡莱尔会照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacob. Hold on, Carlisle is gonna take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.91,1:44:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体右侧的骨骼全部粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bones on the right half of his body are shattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.55,1:44:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 雅各 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bella. - Jake, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.76,1:44:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雅各布你个白痴 我能行的 - 莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jacob, you idiot. I had it. - Leah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.23,1:44:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得在他开始愈合前将骨骼正位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to set the bones before his accelerated healing kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.05,1:44:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经开始了 - 得让他离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's already starting. - We need to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.31,1:44:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没把握能打赢沃尔图里家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna win a fight with the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.38,1:44:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们带他去比利那 - 我会尽快赶到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll take him back to Billy's. - I'll be there as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.72,1:44:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.92,1:44:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.22,1:44:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.71,1:45:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.12,1:45:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见过哪个族群\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a coven.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.53,1:45:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在如此猛烈的进攻中全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape an assault of this magnitude intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.71,1:45:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.66,1:45:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,深表怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.31,1:45:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似我们错过了一场有趣的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears we missed an entertaining fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.12,1:45:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 好像我们突然变得无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's not often we're rendered unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.95,1:45:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们早来半个小时 就能如愿以偿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd arrived a half hour ago, you would've fulfilled your purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.55,1:45:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.51,1:45:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们落下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.01,1:45:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同意她投降 会收容她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We offered her asylum in exchange for her surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.71,1:45:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有这个资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't yours to offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.82,1:46:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.17,1:46:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁创造了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who created you?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.14,1:46:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要折磨她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.68,1:46:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会告诉你想知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll tell you anything you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.64,1:46:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.22,1:46:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.61,1:46:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱利不告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riley wouldn't tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.69,1:46:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们的思想不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said our thoughts weren't safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.99,1:46:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫维多利亚 你或许认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Victoria. Perhaps you knew her.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.21,1:46:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 要是沃尔图里家族知道维多利亚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward. If the Volturi had knowledge of Victoria,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.72,1:46:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会阻止她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would've stopped her.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Jane?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.90,1:46:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.95,1:46:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.22,1:46:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无知者无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't know what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.63,1:46:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会对她负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take responsibility for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.78,1:46:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.93,1:46:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族不会恩赐第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Volturi don't give second chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.21,1:46:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点一定要铭记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.40,1:47:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡鲁斯若知道她还是人类 会很感兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caius will be interested to know that she's still human.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.74,1:47:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,日期已经确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date is set.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.75,1:47:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了 菲利克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of that, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.63,1:47:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.81,1:47:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经有一阵子了 - 医生得把骨头重新打折\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's been going on for a while. - Doc's rebreaking his bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.31,1:47:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要掺和进来 我自己就能捏死那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd he have to butt in? I could've taken that tick…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.16,1:47:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,歇歇吧 莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, give it a rest, Leah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.56,1:48:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最糟糕的过去了 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst is over. He'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.49,1:48:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他用了吗啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him some morphine,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.56,1:48:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的体温会使其很快挥发掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his body temperature will burn it off soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.93,1:48:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来给他输液的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back to set up a drip.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.77,1:48:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.97,1:48:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.24,1:48:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.95,1:48:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.42,1:49:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.66,1:49:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.26,1:49:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜爱德华读到了我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guessed Edward would read my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.70,1:49:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他难为你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he hard on you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.85,1:49:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不恨我 也不恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't even mad at me. Or you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.10,1:49:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.08,1:49:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我想象的好得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.68,1:49:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not playing a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.70,1:49:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.48,1:49:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bella…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.16,1:49:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像你想的那样完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not as perfect as you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.38,1:49:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.52,1:49:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must not talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.10,1:49:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,长痛不如短痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather get all the rebreaking done at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.25,1:50:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我知道自己尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I know I did everything I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.94,1:50:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你承认你对我的感情可真不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't easy making you admit your feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.44,1:50:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直克制自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only fought them,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.50,1:50:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这感情改变不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know they wouldn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.85,1:50:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是最适合你的 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm exactly right for you, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.31,1:50:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我在一起会像呼吸般自然简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be as easy as breathing with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.97,1:50:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.06,1:50:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多想这样就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how much I wish it was enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.85,1:51:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能再来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.07,1:51:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.52,1:51:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll always be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.65,1:51:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我停止心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untill my heart stops beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.71,1:51:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后也依然等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even then.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.14,1:51:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 8月13日吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- August thirteenth? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.12,1:51:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生日前一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a month before my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.11,1:52:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再比你老一岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to be another year older than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.06,1:52:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝说她能搞定婚礼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice said she can get the wedding together by then.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.07,1:52:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she can.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.98,1:52:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用急的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.18,1:52:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了我的生活 我想要马上开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've chosen my life. I want to start living it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.39,1:52:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让爱丽丝操办整个婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, you're gonna let Alice plan the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.26,1:52:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.54,1:52:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,着装 接待 来宾名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dress, the reception, the guest list…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.62,1:52:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道她会邀请谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who knows who she's gonna invite?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.53,1:52:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.62,1:52:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你为何这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know why you're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.61,1:52:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 婚礼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.99,1:52:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试着让身边的所有人快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to make everyone else happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.57,1:52:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你放弃太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're already giving away too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.18,1:52:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.66,1:53:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你和雅各布间的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't a choice between you and Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.75,1:53:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是真我和现在的我之间的抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was between who I should be and who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.66,1:53:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是觉得步调不协调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always felt out of step.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.63,1:53:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生活中跌跌撞撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like literally, stumbling through my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.68,1:53:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都觉得我不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never felt normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.30,1:53:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我就是不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm not normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.53,1:53:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.56,1:53:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的世界中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to face death…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.88,1:53:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不面对死亡 失去和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and loss and pain, in your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.86,1:53:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可同时 我也会更强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I've also never felt stronger…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.85,1:53:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,更真实 更自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}more real, more… my self.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.00,1:53:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那也是我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's my world, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.48,1:54:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我本该属于的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.14,1:54:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 不只是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's not just about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.44,1:54:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.89,1:54:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,思考这些曾让我焦头烂额\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made a mess trying to figure all this out, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.97,1:54:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我想找到正解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna do it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.31,1:54:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想和你紧紧连在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna tie my self to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.22,1:54:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以所有可能的人类的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every way humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.00,1:54:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从婚礼开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.95,1:54:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.21,1:54:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是始于一些更困难的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something, a little more difficult first.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.71,1:54:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许也是更危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe even dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.93,1:54:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先告诉查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.49,1:55:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是相当危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's highly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.71,1:55:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你是防弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing you're bulletproof.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.10,1:55:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把戒指给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need that ring.
